## Frontend Design System — GetDRIP

This project uses the **clay-premium** design skill from GetDRIP.

Before creating or modifying any frontend UI, you MUST:
1. Read `skills/clay-premium/SKILL.md` — it contains the design laws and usage instructions.
2. Use only the design tokens defined in `skills/clay-premium/tokens/` (colors, typography, spacing, shadows, motion).
3. Follow the component patterns in `skills/clay-premium/components/` as reference.
4. Read `skills/clay-premium/philosophy.md` to understand the design intent and mood.

**Core rule:** Never introduce styles, colors, fonts, or visual patterns that contradict the skill's design system. Every UI element you create or edit must be consistent with the **clay-premium** design language.
<!-- getdrip:end -->
